'''Red Luger''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by [[crafting]] a [[Luger]] [[File:LugerUpdated.png|25px|link=Luger]] and 75 [[Gifts 2015|Gifts]] {{Currency|Gift2015}} together during the [[Christmas Event 2015|2015 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
It resembles a metallic redish in color luger pistol, hence the name. However, the toggle pin and the grip of the handle are slightly darker in color.

== Trivia ==
* There was a 49% Chance of crafting the Red Luger and a 51% Chance of crafting its counterpart, [[Green Luger]].
*To [[crafting|craft]] this, players needed a [[Luger]] and 75 [[Gifts 2015|gifts]]. 
*This is one of the reskins of [[Luger]]. The others being [[Lugercane]], [[Green Luger]], [[Ginger Luger]], and [[Chroma Luger]].
*It was a victim of the [[The Duping Glitch (2021)|Duping Glitch (2021)]].
*When salvaged, it provides 230 godly [[shards]].
*This and [[Green Luger]] were the first reskins of Luger released in MM2.
